input.description:
The Prisma schema to convert. Paste the contents of schema.prisma — one or more `model` blocks (one field per line, as Prisma writes them), plus any `enum`, `datasource` and `generator` blocks, e.g. "model User {
  id Int @id @default(autoincrement())
  email String @unique
}". Max 200000 bytes. Nothing is executed.
